sub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TBY</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0311em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7094em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3044em;vertical-align:-2.0123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.2797em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2921em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">资本占用</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2921em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2921em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-1.9581em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2921em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2921em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2921em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">365</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.334em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0123em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子解释了 TBY 的适用边界：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext>普通</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_r^{\\text{普通}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0883em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">普通</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越高（大件、易损、回寄贵）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 越高（尺码不确定性适中而非极端）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 越短（承运商快、窗口紧），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 越容易为正。反过来，低客单价商品的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 小、资本占用可忽略，但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>f</mi><mtext>TBY</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_f^{\\text{TBY}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2605em;vertical-align:-0.4192em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TBY</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4192em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 占售价比例过高，此时用<strong>免费退货 + 尺码推荐</strong>更划算。</p>\n<p>因此 TBY 的选品策略应当是<strong>组合</strong>而非全站开放：把 TBY 限定在退货率最高、客单价足以覆盖物流成本的少数 SKU 上，其余流量用置信度分层的推荐 + 尺码表承担。哪些流量该走哪条兜底分支，由同章<a href=\"try-before-buy-rollout-ops\">Try-before-buy 上线与运营</a>中的分档路由决定；而 TBY 与推荐引擎共享尺码表与用户档案的耦合关系，见<a href=\"fit-recommender-size-chart-architecture\">尺码表与合身推荐引擎架构</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运营控制与度量\">运营控制与度量</h2><p>TBY 需要一个<strong>独立的度量看板</strong>，否则它会伪装成「转化率提升工具」——因为它在短期内确实提升转化，代价藏在几个月后的核销与损耗里。核心指标分三层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>流程健康度</strong>：窗口内决策率、超时无动作率、回寄单号回填率、授权释放时延中位数。这些指标恶化会先于财务指标恶化，是早期预警。</li>\n<li><strong>单位经济</strong>：单次 TBY 会话的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>、留购率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>、资本占用天数、逆向质检折价率。它们决定 TBY 是否该扩容。</li>\n<li><strong>合身信号质量</strong>：试用后不购买率按 SKU 分档——这是推荐器信噪比最高的标签。试穿不合身而不留购，等于用户明确标注「这个尺码不合适」，且比普通退货干净（没有物流损坏、后悔、比价等噪声），可直接回灌到推荐训练。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>超时无动作是政策必须<strong>显式定义</strong>的分支，不存在「合理默认」。两种可选政策各有权衡：默认结算（保护收入，但引发拒付与客服）与默认释放（保护体验，但承担全部正向物流成本）。选择依据是品类退货率与承运商可靠性，且必须在结账前向用户明确披露。这一决策的量化基础来自退货驱动分析：哪些 SKU 的超时风险最高，可由<a href=\"../return-driver-fit-diagnosis/return-rate-baseline-segmentation\">退货率基线与分层分档</a>给出的分档结果支撑。</p>\n<p>监管侧有两条硬约束必须内建。其一，<strong>消费者撤回权</strong>：欧盟《消费者权利指令》2011/83/EU 与 2023/2673 号指令要求远程销售提供不少于 14 天的无理由撤回期，TBY 的试用窗口与之叠加时必须取更有利于消费者的口径，不能借试用窗口缩短法定撤回期。其二，<strong>冷静期</strong>：英国《消费者信贷法》1974 对消费信贷类安排提供 14 天冷静期，TBY 若被认定为信贷安排（延期付款），需按消费信贷框架披露总成本与撤回方式。把这两条内建进流程引擎的窗口计算，而非在法务评审时才发现，是设计阶段就该做的。以上法规条款为公开成文法，可按编号在 EUR-Lex 与 legislation.gov.uk 核验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Try-before-buy 的成败不在结账页，而在<strong>库存、支付、物流、逆向、风控五个接缝是否被建模为同一条可回滚的履约流程</strong>。可运营的落地要点有四条。<strong>第一，状态机先于代码</strong>——把预留、授权持有、捕获、释放、超时五个状态及其转换显式定义，任何按普通订单语义实现的环节都会在窗口结束时对不上账。<strong>第二，预留语义与扣减语义必须分离</strong>——试用件占用的是预留额度，不是可售库存，且必须有超时释放与强制释放两条路径。<strong>第三，经济性用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 核算而非感觉</strong>——当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>f</mi><mtext>TBY</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_f^{\\text{TBY}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2605em;vertical-align:-0.4192em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TBY</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4192em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 占售价比例过高或留购率过低时，TBY 是亏损的，此时免费退货加推荐更划算，选品应当组合而非全站开放。<strong>第四，政策分支必须显式且合规</strong>——超时无动作只能「默认结算」或「默认释放」二选一并向用户披露，试用窗口不得压缩欧盟与英国法定的撤回权与冷静期。把试用后不购买的信号回灌推荐训练，是这条流程顺带产出的最高价值资产——它把一次昂贵的履约实验变成持久的确定性提升。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"先试后买与合身保障履约流程设计","id":"先试后买与合身保障履约流程设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：Try-before-buy 是履约流程，不是支付方式","id":"核心概念-try-before-buy-是履约流程-不是支付方式"},{"level":2,"text":"履约流程的五个系统接缝","id":"履约流程的五个系统接缝"},{"level":3,"text":"争议与拒付的举证责任","id":"争议与拒付的举证责任"},{"level":2,"text":"经济性核算：TBY 什么时候真的削减退货","id":"经济性核算-tby-什么时候真的削减退货"},{"level":2,"text":"运营控制与度量","id":"运营控制与度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"尺码表与合身推荐引擎架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/return-reduction-fit-assurance-program/fit-assurance-program/fit-recommender-size-chart-architecture"},"next":{"title":"Try-before-buy 与免运费退货的项目落地运营","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/return-reduction-fit-assurance-program/fit-assurance-program/try-before-buy-rollout-ops"}}